## Open Questions

> [!NOTE]
> 1. **Scheduler Preference**: Do you prefer an **in-process threaded scheduler (Flask-APScheduler / BackgroundScheduler)** that requires zero external services, or would you prefer a standalone **Redis + RQ / Celery** stack? *(Default recommendation: in-process scheduler for zero friction)*.
> 2. **REST API Authentication**: Should the `/api/v1` routes support **API Keys / Personal Access Tokens (PAT)** (simpler, revokable per user) or **JWT Bearer Tokens** (stateless)? *(Default recommendation: Personal Access Tokens stored hashed in the database)*.

